{"4861490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Otter Cafe","steam_appid":4861490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1016 height=192 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Cafe<\/strong> is a desktop companion that combines idle management with practical everyday tools.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place it wherever you like on your desktop. Watch the animals take their seats, the chef prepare meals, and the servers carry dishes back and forth, adding a few small moments worth looking up for during your work or study breaks.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Regular Has Arrived<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a few small tables, collect guests and recipes, expand the cafe step by step, and welcome more new faces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite table styles, counters, and decorations, then pick an outfit for each server. Click around the cafe from time to time and you may discover a little surprise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leopard cats, Taiwan pangolins, sika deer, and even a cup of bubble tea—the familiar sights of Taiwan are part of this little cafe's everyday life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=838 height=272 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take a Break and Let the Animals Visit the Next Screen<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up an animal and give it a gentle toss. Watch it fly out of the cafe, land on the taskbar, and wobble away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have multiple monitors? The animals can travel between them too. If they reach a lower desktop area, they will even drop down to the next level. Your desktop becomes their walking route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for the cockroach that sneaks into the cafe… this time, you will have to deal with it yourself. Grab the fly swatter and smack! Keep going and you may even unlock the familiar blue-and-white flip-flops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyday Tools Inside the Cafe<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Desktop Sticky Notes**<\/strong>: Write down tasks, save an idea, or doodle an otter for the day.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Calculator**<\/strong>: Open it whenever you need to work out a quick number.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**YouTube Browser**<\/strong>: Open YouTube in a separate window and let your favorite videos keep you company.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Focus Pigeon Pomodoro Timer**<\/strong>: Write down what you want to finish, then send the letter. When the time is up, the pigeon will remind you with a coo.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Multi-Set Workout Timer**<\/strong>: At the Gorilla Gym, customize your workout time, rest time, and number of sets, then move along with the otter lifting dumbbells on screen.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for a while, then take a break. Your tasks can be completed one step at a time, and your body deserves some care too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1136 height=454 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/4830ced21aba7ed844251a4d73c524d9.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1170 height=497 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/4830ced21aba7ed844251a4d73c524d9.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Some Friends Bring Surprises When They Visit<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Taiwan blue magpie here will not swoop at your head. Try the prize wheel and bring home shells or stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pelican drops by with a gift, while the diligent ladybug watches over the bell, waiting for you to ring it and call in more guests.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious visitors may appear at the cafe from time to time. Leave a little room for surprise and discover them for yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=838 height=272 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Piece of the Creator's Life<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“A pigeon used to wake me up at five every morning, so I decided to turn it into a Pomodoro timer. This time, I get to decide when it calls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workout timer came from wanting to lose weight myself, and needing a small tool that could handle workout time, rest time, and multiple rounds. While making it, I thought it would be fun to bring it into the cafe so everyone could use it too.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope these cute little animals can make an ordinary day feel a little more adorable.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1016 height=192 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/63dd3054ecbd72402a20e3aa113a1715.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Cafe<\/strong> is a desktop companion that combines idle management with practical everyday tools.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place it wherever you like on your desktop. Watch the animals take their seats, the chef prepare meals, and the servers carry dishes back and forth, adding a few small moments worth looking up for during your work or study breaks.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Regular Has Arrived<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a few small tables, collect guests and recipes, expand the cafe step by step, and welcome more new faces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite table styles, counters, and decorations, then pick an outfit for each server. Click around the cafe from time to time and you may discover a little surprise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leopard cats, Taiwan pangolins, sika deer, and even a cup of bubble tea—the familiar sights of Taiwan are part of this little cafe's everyday life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=838 height=272 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/290851624070d2c3a6e58c5ac7f5ced9.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take a Break and Let the Animals Visit the Next Screen<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up an animal and give it a gentle toss. Watch it fly out of the cafe, land on the taskbar, and wobble away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have multiple monitors? The animals can travel between them too. If they reach a lower desktop area, they will even drop down to the next level. Your desktop becomes their walking route.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for the cockroach that sneaks into the cafe… this time, you will have to deal with it yourself. Grab the fly swatter and smack! Keep going and you may even unlock the familiar blue-and-white flip-flops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/fc5e4af6cff4095ea9d509a085dbc877.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyday Tools Inside the Cafe<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Desktop Sticky Notes**<\/strong>: Write down tasks, save an idea, or doodle an otter for the day.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Calculator**<\/strong>: Open it whenever you need to work out a quick number.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**YouTube Browser**<\/strong>: Open YouTube in a separate window and let your favorite videos keep you company.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Focus Pigeon Pomodoro Timer**<\/strong>: Write down what you want to finish, then send the letter. When the time is up, the pigeon will remind you with a coo.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**Multi-Set Workout Timer**<\/strong>: At the Gorilla Gym, customize your workout time, rest time, and number of sets, then move along with the otter lifting dumbbells on screen.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work for a while, then take a break. Your tasks can be completed one step at a time, and your body deserves some care too.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1136 height=454 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/e48fa8d3fb735d0d0824016a259e4f41.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/4830ced21aba7ed844251a4d73c524d9.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=1170 height=497 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/4830ced21aba7ed844251a4d73c524d9.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Some Friends Bring Surprises When They Visit<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Taiwan blue magpie here will not swoop at your head. Try the prize wheel and bring home shells or stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pelican drops by with a gift, while the diligent ladybug watches over the bell, waiting for you to ring it and call in more guests.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious visitors may appear at the cafe from time to time. Leave a little room for surprise and discover them for yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.poster.avif?t=1793680210\" width=838 height=272 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.webm?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/extras\/90989f81f8abb4333c558439ebd93700.mp4?t=1793680210\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Little Piece of the Creator's Life<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“A pigeon used to wake me up at five every morning, so I decided to turn it into a Pomodoro timer. This time, I get to decide when it calls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workout timer came from wanting to lose weight myself, and needing a small tool that could handle workout time, rest time, and multiple rounds. While making it, I thought it would be fun to bring it into the cafe so everyone could use it too.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope these cute little animals can make an ordinary day feel a little more adorable.<\/p>","short_description":"Run a cozy otter cafe on your desktop. Welcome animal guests, collect recipes, outfits, and decorations, then toss the otters across your monitors. Sticky notes, a calculator, YouTube, a Pomodoro pigeon, and a workout timer keep you company.","supported_languages":"English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/d252d846a8900c6564cc5f15d03e27c965dd9b9b\/header.jpg?t=1793680210","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/e8a41a915a9e385f810150d899358db5daf69028\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793680210","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861490\/e8a41a915a9e385f810150d899358db5daf69028\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793680210","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 G